---
layout: base.njk
title: What's new
description: Every Deaftly release, newest first, with what changed and a download for each version.
---
<div class="wrap section section--tight prose">
<h1>What's new</h1>
<p class="lede">Every Deaftly release, newest first. To update, download the latest version and install it over the top. Your templates and settings are kept.</p>
{% for entry in release.releases %}
<article class="release">
<div class="release__head">
<h2>Version {{ entry.version }}</h2>
{% if loop.first %}<span class="badge badge--accent">Latest</span>{% endif %}
</div>
<p class="muted"><time datetime="{{ entry.publishedAt | isoDate }}">{{ entry.publishedAt | longDate }}</time></p>
{% if entry.notes.length %}
<ul>
{% for note in entry.notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Small fixes and improvements.</p>
{% endif %}
<a class="release__download" href="{{ entry.apkUrl }}">Download version {{ entry.version }} ({{ entry.apkSizeMb }} MB)</a>
</article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
